<title>UK: DNIB sets $200 million bond. [CORRECTED 15:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>DNIB sets $200 million bond. [CORRECTED 15:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INVESTERINGSBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    29.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.476   PAY DATE   S26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    100.076   SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p>(Lead Manager corrects Full fees from 0.225 to 1.625.)</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>(Lead Manager corrects Management and underwriting fees from 0.175 to 0.225 and corrects Selling concession from 0.05 to 1.40.)</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
